// Larval Idol of Obox-ob

@0 = ~Larval Idol of Obox-ob~
// @1 = ~~

@10 = ~This is the larval form of the Verminous Idol of Obox-ob that is sometimes spawned in victims of Abyssal Corruption. This small, many-eyed stone parasite grows slowly, feeding upon corruption until it matures into a full Verminous Idol.

The idol infects its victims by a disease that severely weakens the target. Unlike the disease caused by the Verminous Idol, it is not lethal and usually disappars by itself after some time if left uncured.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
– Cause Disease three times per day (Save vs. Death to negate)
  Range: Visual range of the user
  Duration: 8 hours
  Area of Effect: 1 creature
  Victim becomes infected with a disease that saps the target of 3 points of Strength, Dexterity, and Charisma. It also deals 1 HP damage every three rounds. Undead and constructs are not affected.
  Each use has a 10% chance to let the larval idol grow into a fully developed Verminous Idol.

Weight: 2~
// @11 = ~~
